WEBVTT

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:15.780
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:15.780
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:20.200
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:20.200
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:24.000
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:24.000
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:36.180
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:36.180
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:39.100
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:39.100
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:41.640
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:41.640
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:44.940
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:44.940
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:49.320
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:49.320
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:54.820
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:54.820
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:59.160
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:59.160
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:04.540
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:04.540
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:09.500
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:09.500
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:13.710
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:13.710
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.810
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.810
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:27.770
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:27.770
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:31.520
<i>And dream my dream</i>

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:31.520
<i>yume wo miru</i>

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:33.860
<i>And know my dream</i>

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:33.860
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

00:01:42.370 --> 00:01:50.580
NOW I SLICE EVERYTHING

00:01:51.250 --> 00:01:54.510
<i>Why am I alive?</i>

00:01:55.840 --> 00:02:01.100
<i>I thought Hyunckel pierced both my hearts,
killing me.</i>

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:03.140
<i>And this...</i>

00:02:03.140 --> 00:02:05.680
That is due to Dark Aura.

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:13.070
I see. You used your Dark Aura power
to resurrect me.

00:02:14.070 --> 00:02:17.400
Is my body even more powerful than before?

00:02:17.900 --> 00:02:22.320
That is the secret of the body
King Vearn has bestowed you with.

00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:24.540
Should you die,

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:29.940
so long as the Dark Aura of King Vearn
or myself remains, you can be resurrected.

00:02:29.940 --> 00:02:33.630
And with far greater power than before.

00:02:33.630 --> 00:02:36.260
Is that why you were placed under me?

00:02:36.630 --> 00:02:42.310
Hadlar, your body belongs
to the almighty King Vearn.

00:02:42.310 --> 00:02:45.220
You can no longer choose your own death.

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:49.650
<i>Should you die, you will return
only to fight on.</i>

00:02:49.650 --> 00:02:53.230
<i>For your master, King Vearn.</i>

00:02:53.690 --> 00:02:55.650
Gladly.

00:02:56.730 --> 00:02:58.110
Where are you going?

00:02:58.110 --> 00:03:00.240
Back to the battlefield.

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:06.950
<i>For a silent man of shadows,
he's certainly become quite chatty.</i>

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:09.420
It's done.

00:03:09.420 --> 00:03:10.370
I've hit...

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:11.790
my target!

00:03:18.840 --> 00:03:25.430
<i>The power of that core keeps the hot and
cold sides of Flazzard's body together.</i>

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:27.980
<i>With it now gone...</i>

00:03:27.980 --> 00:03:30.730
Crap! I can't maintain my body!

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:35.020
If I remain together I'll vaporize myself!

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:44.490
Now, Popp!

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:45.620
Right!

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:47.410
Sizzle!

00:03:53.370 --> 00:03:54.900
Take that!

00:03:54.900 --> 00:03:56.290
Well done, Dai!

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:00.960
So, what about him?

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:04.760
I'll pulverize him
so he can't rebuild himself!

00:04:05.510 --> 00:04:06.970
Wait! Please don't!

00:04:07.970 --> 00:04:08.930
Prepare yourself!

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:18.860
The Shadow Vizier...

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:20.730
Mystvearn!

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:25.070
Mystvearn, you've gotta help me! Please!

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:29.830
I can't just die like this! Do something!

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:40.130
What the hell is that?

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:44.430
The ultimate armour of my Shadow Legion.

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:52.020
If you would become burning Dark Aura,
in other words, a Dark Fire Energy,

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:53.350
it can be yours.

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:57.730
What?! That would mean
becoming your servant!

00:04:57.730 --> 00:05:00.020
I'm not doing that!

00:05:02.690 --> 00:05:08.280
If... If I really merge with that,
I can beat them?

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:10.200
You will be unrivaled.

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:15.330
Fine!

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:17.460
Do it!

00:05:53.490 --> 00:05:56.210
The power! The power is overwhelming!

00:05:57.040 --> 00:05:59.540
Such unbelievable, extraordinary power!

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:02.500
This is amazing!

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:05.760
Stand back! I am
the great swordsman of Papnica...

00:06:08.430 --> 00:06:10.010
W-What is that?!

00:06:10.550 --> 00:06:12.390
Baduck! Gomechan!

00:06:12.390 --> 00:06:16.930
Oh no! They chose
the worst time to show up!

00:06:29.150 --> 00:06:30.660
W-What?!

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:40.380
Crocodine!

00:06:40.380 --> 00:06:41.580
Old timer!

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:44.800
Crackle!

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:48.090
My spell's not working!

00:06:54.510 --> 00:06:57.190
This body is amazing!

00:06:57.190 --> 00:07:00.150
It's stronger and faster
than I used to be!

00:07:00.150 --> 00:07:03.360
And it's immune to spells!

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:09.650
<i>I'll be taking you out later. But first...</i>

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:14.580
I need to crush this little brat!

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:15.370
He's coming!

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:20.660
Get back, Maam. He's after me.

00:07:20.660 --> 00:07:23.460
You can't! You don't have the strength!

00:07:26.630 --> 00:07:29.090
You've got some guts, kid!

00:07:29.090 --> 00:07:33.720
You're begging me to send you
to the afterlife with one punch!

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:36.680
Dai!

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:42.350
What...?!

00:07:42.350 --> 00:07:43.350
Dai!

00:07:43.350 --> 00:07:47.070
It's okay, Maam. I can win.

00:07:47.860 --> 00:07:52.280
I don't know why,
but I don't feel like I can lose to him.

00:07:52.280 --> 00:07:53.990
You can't lose to me?!

00:07:53.990 --> 00:07:56.990
You do nothing but
spout your annoying words!

00:07:57.370 --> 00:08:02.830
That's why I can't stand you,
you little brat!

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:07.420
Why you...!

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:14.260
He's reading the movements
of all those powerful attacks!

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:16.640
And with his eyes closed!

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:17.970
It's complete.

00:08:19.970 --> 00:08:25.570
By obtaining Air Slash, Dai's completed
his Avan Style Sword Technique.

00:08:25.570 --> 00:08:29.480
It means that super attack
is also complete.

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:31.690
By super attack, you mean...?!

00:08:32.150 --> 00:08:35.660
Dai subconsciously understands
its destructive power.

00:08:35.990 --> 00:08:39.830
That's why he knows he can win!

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:47.050
You're kidding! This is impossible!
I'm supposed to be invincible!

00:08:47.050 --> 00:08:51.590
I've got the ultimate body!
I can't lose to this brat!

00:08:52.050 --> 00:08:54.930
With this power and this durability...

00:08:56.090 --> 00:08:57.800
if I lose now...

00:09:00.430 --> 00:09:02.470
I'll look like an idiot!

00:09:03.730 --> 00:09:05.140
<i>Slice the earth...</i>

00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:07.230
<i>Slice the sea...</i>

00:09:08.110 --> 00:09:09.440
<i>Slice the air...</i>

00:09:10.270 --> 00:09:12.780
<i>And slice everything...</i>

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:14.780
<i>I was able to do Air Slash.</i>

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:19.700
<i>I know... I know I can slice everything!</i>

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:22.540
Here it comes!

00:09:25.620 --> 00:09:27.830
Watch me, Master Avan!

00:09:28.460 --> 00:09:30.880
This is... This is a true...

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:34.170
Avan Strash!

00:09:35.630 --> 00:09:37.130
He did it!

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:41.600
Magnificent.

00:09:44.100 --> 00:09:49.320
Oh wow! So that's the power
of the complete Avan Strash!

00:09:49.320 --> 00:09:53.860
It rivals Avan, no,
it might be even more powerful.

00:09:53.860 --> 00:09:55.150
Well done.

00:09:57.280 --> 00:09:58.490
Dai!

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:10.750
Y-You lied to me, you bastard!

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:13.970
How is that the ultimate armour?!

00:10:13.970 --> 00:10:18.430
That was indeed
the ultimate armour of my army.

00:10:19.390 --> 00:10:21.010
If it was destroyed,

00:10:21.510 --> 00:10:26.060
it merely means your foe's attack
was that much stronger.

00:10:26.060 --> 00:10:29.480
Please! Give me another chance!

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:30.400
Mystvear--

00:10:35.570 --> 00:10:39.030
Who does such a thing to their own ally?

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:45.490
<i>Did Mystvearn use Flazzard
to test Dai's strength?</i>

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:50.790
<i>It looks like he's truly
the most dangerous among the Dark Army.</i>

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:54.090
Let's hurry! To the Princess in the tower!

00:10:54.090 --> 00:10:55.880
Oh! That's right!

00:10:55.880 --> 00:11:00.220
Now that that monster is dead, the ice
of his Forbidden Magic should be gone!

00:11:00.630 --> 00:11:06.020
He was a right bastard, but that was
a pretty horrible way to go.

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:09.520
Should we gather the fragments
and make a grave?

00:11:09.520 --> 00:11:10.850
No need.

00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:16.110
That's his gravestone.

00:11:19.110 --> 00:11:21.570
AVAN STRASH

00:11:23.950 --> 00:11:26.580
DARK PUPPETRY AURA HAND

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:31.540
Huh?! Why?!

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:33.540
What's the meaning of this?!

00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:36.670
It hasn't melted at all!

00:11:36.670 --> 00:11:38.880
No, it's started to melt.

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:40.130
Then why?!

00:11:40.630 --> 00:11:43.260
It seems we were too late.

00:11:43.640 --> 00:11:45.390
Too late?!

00:11:45.390 --> 00:11:48.730
Flazzard is dead
and his Forbidden Magic is dispelled.

00:11:48.730 --> 00:11:55.520
But it appears the Princess doesn't have
the strength to break free of its effects.

00:11:55.810 --> 00:11:57.020
What?!

00:11:57.440 --> 00:12:00.110
Princess! Princess!

00:12:02.660 --> 00:12:07.030
<i>Your Princess' life ends
tomorrow at sundown!</i>

00:12:07.490 --> 00:12:08.290
Sizz!

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:15.460
It's barely melted!

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:18.000
In that case... Sizzle!

00:12:18.630 --> 00:12:20.880
Popp, hang in there!

00:12:20.880 --> 00:12:22.890
You can do it!

00:12:22.890 --> 00:12:27.810
It's no good!
A normal spell can barely melt it!

00:12:27.810 --> 00:12:31.900
Then I'll have to risk it
and try shattering it with this!

00:12:31.900 --> 00:12:35.770
A-And what if you
shatter the Princess, too?!

00:12:36.860 --> 00:12:39.400
Is there anything else we can do?

00:12:39.400 --> 00:12:40.530
I know!

00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:42.950
This contains a Sizz spell.

00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:48.580
If we charge it with a Sizzle spell,
maybe it can fire an even greater heat?

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:51.580
I've never charged
more that one spell, though.

00:12:51.950 --> 00:12:55.830
If you do that,
your Magic Bullet Gun might break!

00:12:56.330 --> 00:13:00.590
What are you talking about?!
This is the Princess' life here!

00:13:00.590 --> 00:13:03.590
The Magic Bullet Gun isn't just some item!

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:08.680
Master Avan made it.
It's all that's left of him!

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:12.730
Let's try it.

00:13:13.560 --> 00:13:17.520
Master said this weapon
was for helping people.

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:22.230
I'm sure he made it for times like this!

00:13:22.230 --> 00:13:24.450
Okay. Fine.

00:13:25.650 --> 00:13:26.490
Hand it over.

00:13:30.990 --> 00:13:31.980
Huh?

00:13:31.980 --> 00:13:32.870
Huh?

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:35.040
What's wrong, Popp?!

00:13:36.120 --> 00:13:37.920
He's out of Magic Power!

00:13:37.920 --> 00:13:44.760
Hey Popp! You can't give up!
You're the only one who can use Sizzle!

00:13:51.010 --> 00:13:56.810
<i>If I really do have a mysterious power
like everyone says...</i>

00:13:58.150 --> 00:14:02.860
<i>then let me use that power,
not to fight...</i>

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:05.990
<i>but to save a life.</i>

00:14:06.900 --> 00:14:09.320
<i>To save Leona's life!</i>

00:14:12.330 --> 00:14:14.540
What is that mark?!

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:19.710
That's the mystic power within Dai!

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:22.750
But it's not coming from anger!

00:14:23.090 --> 00:14:25.210
It's responding to something
other than battle!

00:14:27.720 --> 00:14:28.880
Sizzle!

00:14:31.640 --> 00:14:32.760
It's charged!

00:14:32.760 --> 00:14:33.680
Maam!

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:34.430
Right!

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:41.400
Please...

00:14:56.410 --> 00:14:57.410
Leona!

00:15:02.920 --> 00:15:05.090
Leona... She's alive!

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:06.800
She's alive!

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:09.840
Thank goodness!

00:15:10.180 --> 00:15:11.090
Thank goodness.

00:15:13.550 --> 00:15:15.430
<i>I'm sorry, Magic Bullet Gun.</i>

00:15:15.850 --> 00:15:17.850
<i>But it's okay, right?</i>

00:15:18.310 --> 00:15:22.440
<i>Thanks to you, a person's life was saved.</i>

00:15:23.810 --> 00:15:26.070
<i>Thank you for everything.</i>

00:15:26.070 --> 00:15:29.410
Hey, you lot! Are you alive?!

00:15:29.410 --> 00:15:30.860
That voice...?!

00:15:31.360 --> 00:15:33.030
Mentor!

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:35.960
Okay! The food's ready!

00:15:35.960 --> 00:15:36.830
Where does this...

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:40.370
A feast! A victory feast!

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:43.460
Food goes there! Fruits over there!

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:47.970
The Papnica soldiers who were scattered
have begun to gather.

00:15:47.970 --> 00:15:51.510
They heard you rescued the Princess.

00:15:52.550 --> 00:15:57.310
You really saved us by fixing
the Balloon Ship and coming for us.

00:15:57.970 --> 00:15:59.770
-Princess!
-The Princess!

00:15:59.770 --> 00:16:01.140
Princess!

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:07.730
Leona!

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:12.740
Leona!
Thank goodness you're all better!

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:17.410
Your face was all pale like a King Squid
so I was worried about you!

00:16:19.580 --> 00:16:24.090
W-What, Leona? Have you forgotten me?

00:16:24.090 --> 00:16:27.090
Honestly! Give me a break, Dai!

00:16:27.090 --> 00:16:31.140
It's supposed to be the emotional reunion
between the Princess and her rescuer!

00:16:31.140 --> 00:16:32.630
Try to read the room!

00:16:32.930 --> 00:16:34.970
Huh? Huh?!

00:16:36.850 --> 00:16:38.810
Cheers!

00:16:39.640 --> 00:16:42.810
You have all fought bravely.

00:16:43.190 --> 00:16:46.400
Especially Dai and the other
Disciples of Avan.

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:48.270
No words can express our gratitude.

00:16:50.030 --> 00:16:56.820
My father was right to send
Master Avan as a Hero's Tutor.

00:16:56.820 --> 00:17:02.880
The King of Papnica was killed
during the Dark Army's attack.

00:17:02.880 --> 00:17:09.500
Since then, the Princess has united
the people and continued to fight.

00:17:09.880 --> 00:17:13.800
Tell me, Dai, is that swordsman also
a Disciple of Avan?

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:14.550
Huh?!

00:17:14.550 --> 00:17:15.260
Oh crap!

00:17:15.260 --> 00:17:17.340
Uh, well, of course he is!

00:17:17.760 --> 00:17:19.850
Then I should thank him.

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:24.730
Princess Leona, there's something
I have to tell you.

00:17:24.730 --> 00:17:26.570
Uh, Leona, he's, well...

00:17:26.570 --> 00:17:27.440
I am...

00:17:27.980 --> 00:17:31.240
The Undead Legion Commander
of the Dark Army, Hyunckel!

00:17:31.240 --> 00:17:32.610
The Dark Army?!

00:17:32.610 --> 00:17:34.240
The Undead Legion Commander?!

00:17:39.070 --> 00:17:40.410
That idiot!

00:17:40.410 --> 00:17:42.330
Is that true?

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:46.290
Wait a minute!
He's not in the Dark Army anymore!

00:17:46.290 --> 00:17:51.510
That's right! He's awakened to his duty
as a Disciple of Avan and helped us!

00:17:51.510 --> 00:17:54.300
No matter how I may have atoned for it,

00:17:54.300 --> 00:17:59.770
the fact remains that, as Undead Legion
Commander, I destroyed this country.

00:17:59.770 --> 00:18:02.310
I must be punished.

00:18:03.350 --> 00:18:07.350
Princess Leona, I ask that you judge me.

00:18:07.810 --> 00:18:09.940
You can cut me down now if be it.

00:18:09.940 --> 00:18:11.530
Hyunckel!

00:18:11.530 --> 00:18:16.950
I was blessed to be saved
and to lend my strength to Dai.

00:18:17.610 --> 00:18:19.870
I can die fulfilled.

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:21.950
Hyunckel...

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:27.830
as you wish, I Leona, Princess of Papnica,
shall pass judgment upon you.

00:18:28.120 --> 00:18:34.420
You will spend the rest of your life,
serving your duty as a Disciple of Avan.

00:18:36.420 --> 00:18:41.720
You will risk your life to fight
for friendship, justice, and love.

00:18:41.720 --> 00:18:46.650
And you must never disparage yourself
or become lost in the past

00:18:46.650 --> 00:18:49.190
and cease from moving forward.

00:18:49.190 --> 00:18:50.730
Leona!

00:18:51.150 --> 00:18:53.320
That is all. Is that understood?

00:18:54.570 --> 00:18:55.900
I accept this.

00:18:57.240 --> 00:18:59.950
Let us all move forward together!

00:19:01.030 --> 00:19:04.200
<i>She's more capable than she looks.</i>

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:07.790
<i>Papnica just might rise from the ashes.</i>

00:19:13.090 --> 00:19:15.050
Ah, there you are.

00:19:15.960 --> 00:19:16.840
You.

00:19:16.840 --> 00:19:22.510
We were looking for you.
What are you doing drinking alone here?

00:19:23.970 --> 00:19:28.230
A monster shouldn't
be drinking with humans.

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:34.530
Don't be ridiculous! A hero
is a hero no matter their race!

00:19:34.530 --> 00:19:36.610
Now drink up!

00:19:36.610 --> 00:19:39.240
Cheers to the Princess' savior!

00:19:48.200 --> 00:19:49.370
Delicious.

00:19:50.160 --> 00:19:53.080
This is the most delicious drink
I've ever had!

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:55.590
Mentor! I can't breath here!

00:19:55.590 --> 00:20:01.890
I'm sorry, Princess. I didn't know
Uncle Matoriv would cut loose like that.

00:20:01.890 --> 00:20:06.770
There's no need to be formal.
You can call me Leona, not "Princess."

00:20:06.770 --> 00:20:10.230
Otherwise, I'll start
calling you "Ms. Maam."

00:20:10.230 --> 00:20:11.640
Please don't!

00:20:15.190 --> 00:20:18.860
Hyunckel! What's wrong!?
Where are you going?!

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:21.070
We were going to leave unannounced...

00:20:21.450 --> 00:20:22.660
to Sovereign Rock Castle.

00:20:22.660 --> 00:20:23.740
Sovereign Rock Castle?

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:26.020
The fortress of the Dark Army.

00:20:26.020 --> 00:20:31.870
It's north of Papnica,
deep in the mountains of Guildmain.

00:20:31.870 --> 00:20:35.670
Crocodine and I are going
to check their movements.

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:37.460
Why don't we all go together?

00:20:37.840 --> 00:20:40.550
It'll be easier with just us.

00:20:40.550 --> 00:20:42.170
Please trust us.

00:20:42.550 --> 00:20:44.800
I had a wonderful time today.

00:20:45.470 --> 00:20:49.180
Give my regards to Dai
and the people of Papnica.

00:20:49.180 --> 00:20:51.270
We'll meet again, Maam.

00:20:52.390 --> 00:20:53.690
Take care.

00:21:08.620 --> 00:21:11.330
<i>This man is a monster!</i>

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:15.840
<i>Even Carl Kingdom,
with its dozens of powerful knights,</i>

00:21:15.840 --> 00:21:19.260
<i>is on the brink of ruin
after only five days!</i>

00:21:19.260 --> 00:21:20.460
I see.

00:21:20.920 --> 00:21:24.140
That boy Dai seems quite impressive.

00:21:24.140 --> 00:21:27.510
He managed to fight off
the whole Dark Army.

00:21:27.850 --> 00:21:31.890
He's a strange boy
with a mysterious power.

00:21:31.890 --> 00:21:35.810
When this mark shines on his forehead,

00:21:35.810 --> 00:21:38.190
he exhibits this amazing power...

00:21:38.190 --> 00:21:39.610
A mark?!

00:21:42.900 --> 00:21:48.240
Zaboera, does that mark
resemble the face of a dragon?

00:21:48.240 --> 00:21:49.450
A dragon?

00:21:50.370 --> 00:21:53.290
<i>Now that you mention it,
it does seem similar.</i>

00:21:53.290 --> 00:21:57.170
Damn you, Hadlar!
I know what you're up to!

00:22:20.150 --> 00:22:25.900
<i>Kindness is the magic of kind people</i>

00:22:20.150 --> 00:22:25.900
<i>yasashisa wa yasashii hito ga tsukaeru mahou</i>

00:22:26.070 --> 00:22:32.910
<i>Then do I have no choice
But to just be a normal person?</i>

00:22:26.070 --> 00:22:32.910
<i>jaa boku wa tada no hito de iru shikanaino?</i>

00:22:33.080 --> 00:22:36.120
<i>I'm not sure</i>

00:22:33.080 --> 00:22:36.120
<i>doudarou</i>

00:22:38.420 --> 00:22:44.090
<i>Even if the place I call home may change</i>

00:22:38.420 --> 00:22:44.090
<i>kaeru basho wa ne kawatte yuku kedo</i>

00:22:44.250 --> 00:22:46.630
<i>Listen to me, Mother</i>

00:22:44.250 --> 00:22:46.630
<i>naa kaasan boku wa</i>

00:22:46.800 --> 00:22:52.760
<i>I will never change those I protect</i>

00:22:46.800 --> 00:22:52.760
<i>mamoru hito wo kaetari shinai</i>

00:22:53.220 --> 00:22:57.430
<i>I wonder what you'd say</i>

00:22:53.220 --> 00:22:57.430
<i>anata wa nannte iukana</i>

00:22:57.600 --> 00:23:01.650
<i>At times I can be cowardly and small</i>

00:22:57.600 --> 00:23:01.650
<i>tokiyori yowaki de chippoke de</i>

00:23:01.810 --> 00:23:08.110
<i>What would you say to me
As I hesitate to even hesitate?</i>

00:23:01.810 --> 00:23:08.110
<i>mayou koto ni mo mayou boku ni nannte iukana</i>

00:23:08.280 --> 00:23:13.950
<i>Unlike the today that I sought</i>

00:23:08.280 --> 00:23:13.950
<i>sagashite ita kyou to chigatte</i>

00:23:14.120 --> 00:23:19.250
<i>I'm sure you'd laugh at my disappointment</i>

00:23:14.120 --> 00:23:19.250
<i>ochikonnde shimau boku wo warau no darou</i>

00:23:33.760 --> 00:23:37.220
<i>Dai and friends defeated Flazzard
and rescued Leona.</i>

00:23:37.270 --> 00:23:39.480
<i>As they prepare for their next battle,</i>

00:23:39.480 --> 00:23:43.060
<i>her broken Magic Bullet Gun
leads Maam to a decision.</i>

00:23:43.560 --> 00:23:48.820
<i>Meanwhile, Killvearn the Reaper
appears before Dark Commander Hadlar.</i>

00:23:48.820 --> 00:23:54.240
<i>And Sovereign Rock Castle, the fortress of
the Dark Army, shows its true form.</i>

00:23:54.740 --> 00:23:57.080
DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai<i>,</i>

00:23:57.080 --> 00:23:58.750
<i>"Maam's Decision"</i>

00:23:58.750 --> 00:24:00.660
<i>The adventure continues!</i>
